# The llama.cpp commit every build path in this repo uses.
#
# Why this file exists: the baremetal script, the Vulkan script and both
# Dockerfiles used to clone `master` independently. On 2026-09-08 that produced
# a baremetal install at 465e49b and a Docker image at 67672dc, which made the
# two paths non-comparable — a 4-6% decode difference on the 35B could not be
# attributed to packaging, environment, or upstream changes.
#
# Change this deliberately, then rebuild every path and re-run the benchmarks.
# Format: one bare commit SHA, comments and blank lines ignored.
465e49b9cea78a68b9c244ffb48d0ee24a82873d
